{"unit_id":"chidaic__dsh-agent-notify#card-zh","repo":"chidaic/dsh-agent-notify","commit":"a41c11bda2e13cd094d4db856b93d7a2569c7747","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-notify 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的会话通知插件，通过浏览器端模块订阅会话列表状态，并在会话完成或出现待处理交互时发送系统级通知。它会提示任务完成、问题待回答、操作待批准和计划待审阅；点击通知可聚焦页面并打开对应会话。设置页提供通知开关、子代理通知选项、始终或后台发送模式、权限状态和测试通知，并把偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage。适合希望离开 DSH 页面时仍能留意会话进度的 Web 用户。使用需浏览器支持 Notification API 并授予通知权限，无需额外服务账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:157-180","lib/client.js:265-307","lib/client.js:346-384","lib/client.js:406-449"]}
{"unit_id":"chidaic__dsh-agent-notify#card-en","repo":"chidaic/dsh-agent-notify","commit":"a41c11bda2e13cd094d4db856b93d7a2569c7747","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-notify sends system alerts when DSH Web sessions finish or need a reply, approval, or plan review. Clicking an alert opens its session. Settings control background delivery and subagent alerts. A browser with Notification API permission is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:157-180","lib/client.js:265-307","lib/client.js:346-384","lib/client.js:406-449"]}
